- React Router.
- Dexie database.
- Initial schema.
- Zustand stores.
- Application shell.
- Responsive layout.
- Event creation.
- Event listing.
- Event editing and deletion.

Acceptance criteria:

- Application runs locally.
- Events persist after page reload.
- Light and dark themes work.
- Mobile layout is usable.
- Empty state works.
- No unnecessary backend dependencies exist.

## Phase 2 — Expense Management

Implement:

- Expense data model.
- Expense CRUD.
