# 23. Final Product Direction

EventLedger should remain a focused utility.

The primary workflow is:

```text
Create Event
     |
     v
Add Expenses
     |
     v
Record Payments
     |
     v
Automatically Calculate Balances
     |
     v
Review Outstanding Expenses
     |
     v
Export PDF Report
```

The product should excel at doing these tasks quickly and reliably.

It should not evolve into a general accounting application.

**The guiding principle: Users should spend their time organizing their events, not managing the expense tracker itself.**